<title>NEW ZEALAND: TABLE-Weekly forecasts for NZ10 component stocks.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Weekly forecasts for NZ10 component stocks.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1997-08-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New Zealand Stock Exchange on Friday  published the following consensus forecasts for the constituent companies  in its NZ Top 10 Capital Index  .NZ10C.</p>
<p>It did not detail the number of member brokers contributing to the  survey or brokers' individual forecasts.</p>
<p> COMPANY	OPTG PROFIT  EPS    P/E  GROSS DIV  DIV</p>
<p> NAME	    (NZ$ MLN)  (NZC)	   (NZC)    YIELD</p>
<p> AIR NZ	   142.27    26.00  11.73  23.30    9.26</p>
<p> BRIERLEY INV   307.67    10.53  12.93   9.60    7.90</p>
<p> CARTER HOLT    301.63    17.47  21.67  11.83    3.95</p>
<p> FERNZ	     46.80    32.60  15.82  23.90    4.65</p>
<p> FLETCH BLD     127.30    33.30  13.03  15.17    4.50</p>
<p> FLETCH ENGY    232.87    65.73   7.60  21.13    6.55</p>
<p> FLETCH FORST    73.17     8.90  22.63   7.00    4.60</p>
<p> FLETCH PAPER   (98.17)  -17.03  -9.47   5.50    2.17</p>
<p> INL		 53.13    42.60  18.33  28.20    4.64</p>
<p> LION NATHAN    121.90    21.87  17.83  16.00    4.16</p>
<p> NAT GAS CORP    42.80    13.63  16.70  29.23    4.66</p>
<p> TELECOM	  799.10    43.87  17.40  48.90    6.30</p>
<p> TRANZ RAIL	60.63    48.00  17.60  24.71    2.94</p>
<p>NOTE - Tranz Rail figures are actuals, reported this week. Natural  Gas Corp's gross dividend yield is calculated prior to its conversion  of capital notes.</p>
